SURFACE SCOPE NOTE (web parity)
================================================================================
WidgetEventFeed.tsx is a PRESENTATIONAL primitive (a shared widget building block).
It receives already-built `EventFeedItem`s and renders them; it has NO data-fetching
hook. Its only render branches are EMPTY and POPULATED (the generic
loading/error/stale/offline chrome belongs to the widgets that *consume* this
primitive, e.g. SentryEventLogWidget, which passes the resolved items in). Both
source branches are reproduced natively. Hooks bound: useTranslation -> P1/S10 i18n
facade (WidgetEventFeedStrings); useDateFormat -> injectable absolute-time formatter.
No direct HTTP in the view.

